WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.939
Let us put the headline numbers together.

00:00:03.019 --> 00:00:09.492
The refreshed mC4 has twenty-nine trillion
characters across one hundred seven languages,

00:00:09.572 --> 00:00:12.143
a thirty-five percent size increase.

00:00:12.223 --> 00:00:17.298
On TyDi QA at the larger budget, UniMax scores
eighty-three point one,

00:00:17.378 --> 00:00:19.065
ahead of both baselines.

00:00:19.145 --> 00:00:23.557
The umT5 XXL checkpoint beats the earlier mT5 XXL
on TyDi QA.

00:00:23.637 --> 00:00:27.386
And remember, at tau equals three point three three,

00:00:27.466 --> 00:00:33.350
the lowest-resource languages were being repeated
more than a hundred times over.
